    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1158-a3">

                <pb facs="1237" n="1141" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1141"/>

                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States op Venezuela,<lb/>Office of General
                                Secretary</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Ciudad
                            Bolivar</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1898-05-10"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">May 10</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 724.]</seg></opener>
                <p rendition="#center">[Eighty-seventh and fortieth.]</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">To the magistrate of the district Heres:</hi>
                </p>
                <p>According to testimony taken in this office, the American, Felipe Scandella, has
                    been proven to be in complicity with those parties who are in revolt against the
                    Government, and the President of the State has instructed me to tell you to
                    notify Felipe Scandella to leave the territory of this Federation until public
                    order has been established. God and the Federation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">R. Contasti Laveaux</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>True copy:</p>
                    <closer>
                        <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">R. Contasti Laveaux</hi>.</signed>
                    </closer>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
